  "developmentNotes": [
    "Earlier dirty-tree smoke runs identified asynchronous publication, fixture row detachment that invalidated AX proxies, and opening animation geometry. These are not part of the final 60-trial denominator.",
    "The fixture now reorders existing arranged views without detachment and disables its window animation. Its native ready event remains separate from bounded external CG/AX readiness gates.",
    "Temporary native probes were removed before the final build and run."
